Z||000000||bya72||05-15-2001||11:50 PM||||I've been using my 84 Fiero as a work car this year and am getting ready to do some resoration to it.  I am a teacher, so I have the summer off.  I was planning on spending some time sanding, painting, fixing headlights, and other general stuff.  But, following Murrphy's Law, things have to get screwed up.  For the last month I have been getting some really bad headaches everyday.  They seem to go away on the weekends when the Fiero stays parked, the jeep is in much better shape besides for the 12 miles to the gallon.  I decided to drive the Jeep to work today, 50 mile round trip, just to see if the headaches went away.  Sure enough, no headache today.  To make a long story a little shorter, I need an exaust system.  I am on a limited budget and would like to get some of the other goodies to make it my daily driver.  The Fiero has 1??,000 miles on it.  It runs strong, but still has the original system on there.  I don't have the cash for Borla or any performance kit.  I went to NAPA and they want over 200 for everything but the manifold.  Where can I get a cheaper system?<P>Thanks ||||reg||1
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||05-16-2001||03:01 AM||||Check the price of a stock system at Fiero Store?  <A HREF="http://www.fierostore.com/pegasus/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierostore.com/pegasus/index.html</A> <P>DXR_DAD||||reg||1
